{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "FMR Mock API",
    "description": "\nMock of the **FMR** APIs used by the Meitav Trade agent for **password reset** and **username recovery**,\nshaped like FMR's Swagger v1 (`/api/ExternalProvider/*`).\n\n**Authorize first:** click **Authorize** and paste the API key (`MOCK_API_KEY`).\n\n### Flow\n1. `ValidateExToken`: get `RequestID` + `rjwtToken`\n2. `AccountVerification`: verify the 6-digit trade account (or bank details), get the cards\n3. `ResetPassword` (→ 210, deep link) or `ForgotUsername` (→ 209, secure message) with `SubCard` = card's last 3 digits\n\n### Test accounts\n| Account | Cards | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| `001234` | 771 | Happy path (one card) |\n| `012345` | 025, 418 | Two cards: customer picks |\n| `054321` | 309 | ForgotUsername → **427** (no email) |\n| `067890` | 552 (inactive), 860 | 552 → **436** |\n| `098765` | 144 | Tik = Y (managed account) |\n| any other | – | **404** (HTTP 401), 3 attempts then **423** |\n\n### Bank details (instead of `Account`)\n| Bank / Branch / BankAccount | Trade account | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| `012` / `600` / `123456` | 001234 | One card (771) |\n| `010` / `800` / `554433` | 012345 | Two cards (025, 418) |\n| `020` / `456` / `98765` | 054321 | No email (ForgotUsername → 427) |\n| `011` / `042` / `777888` | 067890 | 552 inactive, 860 |\n| `031` / `123` / `112233` | 054321 **and** 067890 | **418** (joint bank account) |\n| any other full set | – | **404**, 2 attempts then **423** |\n| only 1–2 bank fields | – | **434** |\n| `Account` + bank fields | – | **435** |\n\n### Forms\n`POST /api/formemail/send-form-by-email` emails a filled form (`formName`: `kubiot` or `nispah5`).\nAny recipient works; `@fail.com` / `@error.com` → **500**.\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/formemail/send-form-by-email": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Forms"
        ],
        "summary": "Email a filled form to the customer",
        "description": "Mock of Meitav's `chat-integration-api` `send-form-by-email`. Pick the `data` shape with `formName`: **kubiot** (pension enrolment) or **nispah5** (נספח ה'). No RequestID/RToken needed. The real API also wants the customer's bearer token and the IBM gateway headers `x-ibm-client-id` / `x-ibm-client-secret`; the mock ignores all three.\n\nAny email works, except one at `@fail.com` or `@error.com`, which returns 500 `FORM_SEND_FAILED`. Unknown `formName` or missing `data` fields return 400.",
        "operationId": "send_form_by_email_api_formemail_send_form_by_email_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendFormIn"
              },
              "examples": {
                "kubiot": {
                  "summary": "kubiot: two products (200)",
                  "value": {
                    "email": "customer@example.com",
                    "formName": "kubiot",
                    "data": {
                      "new_filldate": "20/11/2025",
                      "fullName": "ישראל ישראלי",
                      "idNumber": "012345678",
                      "employeName": "מיטב",
                      "HP": "516583036",
                      "monthlyIncome": "3,000",
                      "product": "פנסיה מקיפה",
                      "salaryCategory": "משכורת בסיסית",
                      "ma": "163",
                      "ddovedPayment": "6%",
                      "ddcompensation": "6%",
                      "ddmaasikPayment": "6.5%",
                      "insureIncome": "2,000",
                      "product2": "השתלמות",
                      "salaryCategory2": "משכורת בסיסית",
                      "ma2": "880",
                      "ddovedPayment2": "2.5%",
                      "ddmaasikPayment2": "7.5%",
                      "insureIncome2": "3,000"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "nispah5": {
                  "summary": "nispah5 (200)",
                  "value": {
                    "email": "customer@example.com",
                    "formName": "nispah5",
                    "data": {
                      "emploeeName": "ישראל ישראלי",
                      "idNumber": "012345678",
                      "maasikName": "מיטב",
                      "HP": "516583036",
                      "product": "מיטב פנסיה מקיפה",
                      "accountNum": "18-012345678"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "failed": {
                  "summary": "Send failed (500)",
                  "value": {
                    "email": "customer@fail.com",
                    "formName": "nispah5",
                    "data": {
                      "emploeeName": "ישראל ישראלי",
                      "idNumber": "012345678",
                      "maasikName": "מיטב",
                      "HP": "516583036",
                      "product": "מיטב פנסיה מקיפה",
                      "accountNum": "18-012345678"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Form emailed",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendFormOut"
                },
                "example": {
                  "Status": 200,
                  "Message": "Form sent by email",
                  "FormName": "kubiot",
                  "ReferenceID": "6f1c…"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "BAD_REQUEST",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                },
                "example": {
                  "Status": 400,
                  "Error": "BAD_REQUEST",
                  "Message": "Invalid or missing fields",
                  "Fields": [
                    "data.HP"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "FORM_SEND_FAILED",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                },
                "example": {
                  "Status": 500,
                  "Error": "FORM_SEND_FAILED",
                  "Message": "Form could not be sent"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/ExternalProvider/ValidateExToken": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "FMR (Swagger v1)"
        ],
        "summary": "Validate the external session token (HTTP status = Status)",
        "operationId": "validate_ex_token_api_ExternalProvider_ValidateExToken_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "ExSessionID": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 50,
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "title": "Exsessionid"
                  },
                  "mjwtToken": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 16384,
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "title": "Mjwttoken",
                    "description": "Any value works. `invalid`/`expired` → 400, `active-request` → 430, `duplicate` → 432, `no-card` → 436."
                  }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "ExSessionID",
                  "mjwtToken"
                ],
                "title": "ValidateExRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/ExternalProvider/AccountVerification": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "FMR (Swagger v1)"
        ],
        "summary": "Verify by trade account OR bank details (returns an array)",
        "operationId": "account_verification_api_ExternalProvider_AccountVerification_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "RequestID": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "Requestid"
                  },
                  "rjwtToken": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 16384,
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "title": "Rjwttoken"
                  },
                  "Account": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 10
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Account",
                    "examples": [
                      "012345"
                    ]
                  },
                  "Bank": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "integer"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Bank",
                    "examples": [
                      "012"
                    ]
                  },
                  "Branch": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "integer"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Branch",
                    "examples": [
                      "600"
                    ]
                  },
                  "BankAccount": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "integer"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Bankaccount",
                    "examples": [
                      "123456"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "RequestID",
                  "rjwtToken"
                ],
                "title": "AccountVerificationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/ExternalProvider/ResetPassword": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "FMR (Swagger v1)"
        ],
        "summary": "Request a password-reset deep link",
        "operationId": "reset_password_api_ExternalProvider_ResetPassword_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "RequestID": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "Requestid"
                  },
                  "rjwtToken": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 16384,
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "title": "Rjwttoken"
                  },
                  "SubCard": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 3,
                    "minLength": 3,
                    "title": "Subcard",
                    "examples": [
                      "418"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "RequestID",
                  "rjwtToken",
                  "SubCard"
                ],
                "title": "SubCardRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/ExternalProvider/ForgotUsername": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "FMR (Swagger v1)"
        ],
        "summary": "Request username recovery through a secure message",
        "operationId": "forgot_username_api_ExternalProvider_ForgotUsername_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "RequestID": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "Requestid"
                  },
                  "rjwtToken": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 16384,
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "title": "Rjwttoken"
                  },
                  "SubCard": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 3,
                    "minLength": 3,
                    "title": "Subcard",
                    "examples": [
                      "418"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "RequestID",
                  "rjwtToken",
                  "SubCard"
                ],
                "title": "SubCardRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ErrorOut": {
        "properties": {
          "Status": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Status"
          },
          "Error": {
